From e9efd700fb1821118f1636acaacbad5766102b2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:04:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] pcbnew: AI chat panel for 8.0.9 (Claude Agent SDK bridge;
 runs approved Python inside KiCad, one undo step per run)

8.0.9 has no IPC API, so the bridge asks the panel to run pcbnew Python inside KiCad. Writes are accepted only
for the ids the user approved in the panel, and are recorded as one undo step the same way action plugins are
(no step when nothing changed; rolled back on errors).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
